Changes:
 qt6-base (6.11.2+dfsg-5+stereo3d2) unstable; urgency=medium
 .
   * Sparky Stereo OS: Qt's own client side decorations around a stereo
     window keep both eyes. stereo3d-wayland-no-csd-stereo-window is
     dropped. New patch stereo3d-wayland-egl-eye-slots: the content
     framebuffer of a decorated stereo window gets a color attachment per
     eye, QRhiGles2 draws the right eye of the default framebuffer into
     the second one, and the decorations blit (from a desktop OpenGL
     context) copies each slot into its own back buffer with the
     decoration drawn identically in both.
   * New patch stereo3d-compositor-rebind-second-texture: a stereo QOpenGLWidget
     resized while its window is shown (as a window decorated by Qt is at
     start) left the right eye's shader bindings on a destroyed texture,
     and the next flush crashed.
